Rules:
  [F1] Use Clean Architecture with domain layer.
  [F2] Use BLoC or Riverpod for state management.
  [F3] Use repository pattern for data access.
  [F4] Use dependency injection (get_it).
  [F5] Use feature-first folder structure.
  [F6] Use equatable for value comparison.
  [F7] Use freezed for union types.
  [F8] Use go_router for navigation.

